  message: "2026-10-06 docstring-audit random sample: ImportScope (packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/import_scope.py) has never been constructed by any analyzer — pickaxe over packages/*/src finds no importer in history; only tests/test_import_scope.py uses it. The ExternalRef / Edge.dst_ref IR did land (about 13 analyzers pass dst_ref=), but each builds it inline from its own dicts (py.py ~:2568 still builds symbol_imports / module_imports). The module docstring says 'PR1 of WI-tihup adopts ImportScope in py.py', and CHANGELOG.md:641 (6.0.0) says 'adopted by 18 analyzers via a shared ImportScope abstraction'; both overclaim. This item has had no update since 2026-04-23 and predates PR1 (1d1f01d515). Decision needed: adopt ImportScope, or retire import_scope.py and correct its docstring. I will correct the docstring either way in the next docs PR."  # 6e96
